# X-GIS pre-push gate (ported from .githooks/pre-push when Husky took over
# core.hooksPath). Runs the local precheck (vitest unit suite) so the bulk of
# CI-catchable regressions surface before the network round-trip.
# Cost ~1 min. Skip a push with `git push --no-verify`.
#
# NOTE: `bun run build` (the tsc authority) is intentionally NOT run here — it
# adds minutes most pushes don't need; run it manually before a risky push.
bun run precheck
